What is AI in Telecommunication?
AI in telecommunication refers to the integration of artificial intelligence technologies including machine learning, deep learning, and natural language processing into telecom operations. These cutting-edge solutions enable self-optimizing networks (SON), predictive maintenance systems, fraud detection algorithms, and intelligent virtual assistants. Key applications range from network traffic management to personalized customer engagement through AI-powered chatbots and recommendation engines.

